CC : CCM / CCE / CCB

FM : CCA



Please be informed January 15, 2014 GRI for TPE/ACE as below.

===========================================================================

[TPE]

Tariff Code: HJSC-700

Rule No : 102-Z7

Effective Date : January 15, 2014

===========================================================================

All cargo moving under this tariff is subject to the following amount of General Rate Increase as indicated below.

A. General Rate Increase Amount

1. From : All origins except Japan, Sub-Continent (India, Pakistan, Bangladesh, Colombo), and Middle East
To : All US Destinations (including Mexico via US WC)



- USD 240    Per 20'
- USD 300    Per 40'
- USD 340    Per 40' HIGH CUBE and REEFER Container
- USD 380    Per 45'



B. Effective Date

GRI is effective January 15, 2014.

2. From : Japan, Sub-Continent

Please refer to 102-Z8

3. From : Middle East

GRI is not applicable

===========================================================================





===========================================================================

[ACE]

Tariff Code: HJSC-014

Rule No : 107-AF

Effective Date : January 15, 2014

===========================================================================

All cargo moving under this tariff is subject to the following amount of General Rate Increase as indicated below.



A. General Rate Increase Amount

1. From : All origins except Japan, Sub-Continent (India, Pakistan, Bangladesh, Colombo) and Middle East.
To : Canada



- USD 240    Per 20'
- USD 300    Per 40'
- USD 340    Per 40' HIGH CUBE and REEFER Container
- USD 380    Per 45'



B. Effective Date

GRI is effective January 15, 2014.

2. From : Japan, Sub-Continent (India, Pakistan, Bangladesh, Colombo)

Please refer to 107-AG



3. From : Middle East.

GRI is not applicable.

===========================================================================





